<title>UK: Gefko opens new UK airfreight terminal.</title>
<headline>Gefko opens new UK airfreight terminal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Freight services and logistics group Gefko UK Ltd said a 47,000 square-foot freight terminal it has opened in Slough, near London Heathrow Airport, is now fully operational.</p>
<p>The new building takes over the function of its previous warehouse in West Drayton, which was too small to handle expanding volumes of cargo traffic.</p>
<p>-Air Cargo Newsroom Tel +44 171 542 8982 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
</text>
